WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.600 --> 00:00:10.883
A night-time crash on 18 kilometres of road with no network at all. The crashed car's phone broadcasts the SOS, and any passing car with SENDA picks it up and carries it.

2
00:00:11.233 --> 00:00:21.153
In this simulation, with only one car in ten running SENDA, the alert gets out in about seven minutes. And oncoming cars warn the drivers heading towards the crash.
